# sign_clips_250.npz, which is itself built on Kaggle — so these are derived, not source.
# ⚠️ They are therefore NOT backed up by git. The source of truth for a rebuild is
# sign_clips_250.npz + the lexicons (asl_handedness_250.json, handshape_templates.json,
# asl_2a_base_placement.json), and the lexicons ARE tracked.
animation_handoff/
